<title>GERMANY: Schickedanz says no plans to take over Karstadt.</title>
<headline>Schickedanz says no plans to take over Karstadt.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokesman for Schickedanz group confirmed on Monday that it planned to buy stakes in German retailer Karstadt held by Commerzbank and Deutsche Bank, but said its aim was not to take over the firm.</p>
<p>&quot;Take over is not the aim of buying the stakes,&quot; Schickedanz spokesman Andreas Neuner told Reuters in response to a query.</p>
</text>
